          "filename": "Kilcrea Abbey, Nr Ballincollig, County Cork - geograph.org.uk - 726968.jpg",
          "caption": "Kilcrea Abbey, Nr Ballincollig, County Cork Founded around 1470 as a Franciscan Friary, it was in continual use until well after the Dissolution... until about 1570. It passed through several ownerships, but eventually was taken back by Franciscans, who had some sort occupation until about 1880.\nThe Abbey is open to the public and now in the care of the Board of Works.",
